Frozen v0.124.0 saves for #10830 (restoring pending casts and "as though it had flash"
grants written by the released engine).

Generated by the RELEASED engine. Never regenerate with a newer engine: their value is
that they are byte-for-byte what v0.124.0 wrote.

Generating tag and commit: v0.124.0, 5730c3357255efc44358efe83884e989b976992d
  (upstream phase-rs/phase).

Each board is built with GameScenario from verbatim Oracle text, parsed by the v0.124.0
parser, and driven by GameActions. None is recorded from play.

Serializer: engine-wasm export_game_state_json() (capture_rng_word_pos +
  TrustedGameStateEnvelope::capture), compact JSON, after installing the state in
  GAME_STATE; each file is then compressed with `gzip -9n`.

Command (in a worktree checked out at the commit above, with the generator below appended
to crates/engine-wasm/src/lib.rs):

  FIXTURE_DIR=<dir> cargo test -p engine-wasm --lib generate_v124_fixtures -- --nocapture
  gzip -9n <dir>/*.json

Fixtures (P0's turn; board, then the prompt the save is paused at):
  ward_spell_option: upkeep, Timely Ward targeting; P1 commander Grizzly Bears; TargetSelection.
  ward_leyline: the same with Leyline of Anticipation; TargetSelection.
  azula_ward: P1's Timely Ward exiled by Azula, Cunning Usurper, cast by P0 in its upkeep; TargetSelection.
  naiad_bestow_without_leyline: Nimbus Naiad bestowed, then Leyline removed; TargetSelection.
  wispmare_evoke_without_leyline: Wispmare evoked beside Primal Prayers (energy 2), Leyline removed; ManaPayment.
  opt_paying_without_leyline: Opt, Leyline removed; ManaPayment.
  shock_targeting_without_leyline: Shock, Leyline removed; TargetSelection.
  arc_lightning_division_without_leyline: Arc Lightning on Grizzly Bears and P1, Leyline removed; DistributeAmong.
  blaze_x_without_leyline: Blaze targeting P1, Leyline removed; ChooseXValue.
  defiler_payment_without_leyline: Grizzly Bears beside Defiler of Vigor, Leyline removed; DefilerPayment.
  prayers_gnarlid_energy1: Primal Prayers, Gnarlid Colony, energy 1; Kicker prompt, energy 0, Undecided.
  prayers_gnarlid_energy2: the same with energy 2; Choice(PayEnergy 1, Mana NoCost), energy 1, Offered.
  leyline_prayers_gnarlid_energy2: Leyline, Primal Prayers, Gnarlid Colony, energy 2; the same re-offer.
  leyline_prayers_gnarlid_energy0: Leyline, Primal Prayers, Gnarlid Colony, energy 0; Kicker prompt.
  gnarlid_kicker_without_leyline: Gnarlid Colony, energy 0, Leyline removed; Kicker prompt.
  leyline_prayers_defiler_life_paid: Leyline, Primal Prayers, Defiler of Vigor, Grizzly Bears, 2 life paid; ManaPayment.
  borne_on_the_stack: Slitherwisp, Borne Upon a Wind on the stack, Grizzly Bears and Ambush Viper in hand; Priority.
  borne_resolving_optional_prompt: the same board, Borne resolving; OptionalEffectChoice.
  borne_resolved_bears_paying: the same board, Borne accepted, Grizzly Bears being paid; ManaPayment.
  borne_resolved_chea: Slitherwisp, Chea, Savannah Lions, Borne accepted; Priority.
  crawling_barrens_on_the_stack: Crawling Barrens' {4} ability on the stack; Priority.
  leyline_fist_of_suns_offered: Leyline, Fist of Suns, Grizzly Bears; Choice(Mana WUBRG, Mana {1}{G}), Offered.
  prayers_bears_whisperer_energy2: Primal Prayers, Beast Whisperer, Grizzly Bears, energy 2, empty pool, Auto;
    Choice(PayEnergy 1, Mana NoCost), energy 1, Offered.

Generator source:


// Scratch generator for #10830 r10's frozen v0.124.0 fixtures. Not for commit.
#[cfg(test)]
mod zz_v124_fixture_gen {
    use super::*;
    use engine::game::scenario::{CardBuilder, GameRunner, GameScenario, P0, P1};
    use engine::types::actions::GameAction;
    use engine::types::game_state::CastPaymentMode;
    use engine::types::mana::{ManaCostShard, ManaType, ManaUnit};
    use engine::types::phase::Phase;
    use engine::types::zones::Zone;

    const TIMELY_WARD: &str = "You may cast this spell as though it had flash if it targets a \
commander.\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature has indestructible.";
    const LEYLINE_OF_ANTICIPATION: &str = "If this card is in your opening hand, you may begin \
the game with it on the battlefield.\nYou may cast spells as though they had flash.";
    const PRIMAL_PRAYERS: &str = "When this enchantment enters, you get {E}{E} (two energy \
counters).\nYou may cast creature spells with mana value 3 or less by paying {E} rather than \
paying their mana costs. If you cast a spell this way, you may cast it as though it had flash.";
    const WISPMARE: &str = "Flying\nWhen this creature enters, destroy target enchantment.\n\
Evoke {W} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters.)";
    const AZULA_CUNNING_USURPER: &str = "Firebending 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, add \
{R}{R}. This mana lasts until end of combat.)\nWhen Azula enters, target opponent exiles a \
nontoken creature they control, then they exile a nonland card from their graveyard.\nDuring \
your turn, you may cast cards exiled with Azula and you may cast them as though they had flash. \
Mana of any type can be spent to cast those spells.";
    const NIMBUS_NAIAD: &str = "Bestow {4}{U} (If you cast this card for its bestow cost, it's \
an Aura spell with enchant creature. It becomes a creature again if it's not attached.)\nFlying\n\
Enchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying.";
    const OPT: &str = "Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on \
the bottom.)\nDraw a card.";
    const SHOCK: &str = "Shock deals 2 damage to any target.";
    const ARC_LIGHTNING: &str =
        "Arc Lightning deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets.";
    const BLAZE: &str = "Blaze deals X damage to any target.";
    const DEFILER_OF_VIGOR: &str = "Trample\nAs an additional cost to cast green permanent \
spells, you may pay 2 life. Those spells cost {G} less to cast if you paid life this way. This \
effect reduces only the amount of green mana you pay.\nWhenever you cast a green permanent \
spell, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.";
    const GNARLID_COLONY: &str = "Kicker {2}{G} (You may pay an additional {2}{G} as you cast \
this spell.)\nIf this creature was kicked, it enters with two +1/+1 counters on it.\nEach \
creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has trample. (It can deal excess combat damage \
to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)";
    const BORNE_UPON_A_WIND: &str =
        "You may cast spells this turn as though they had flash.\nDraw a card.";
    const SLITHERWISP: &str = "Flash\nWhenever you cast another spell that has flash, you draw a \
card and each opponent loses 1 life.";
    const CHEA_FRIEND_TO_MAYBE_TOO_MANY: &str = "Familiar spells you cast have flash. (Bats, \
Birds, Cats, Dragons, Faeries, Foxes, Frogs, Imps, Lizards, and Spiders are familiars, as well as \
any creature with \"Familiar\" in its name.)\n{T}: Add X {G} and each opponent loses X life, \
where X is the number of familiars you control.";
    const BEAST_WHISPERER: &str = "Whenever you cast a creature spell, draw a card.";

    fn timely_ward(builder: &mut CardBuilder<'_>) -> ObjectId {
        builder
            .as_enchantment()
            .with_subtypes(vec!["Aura"])
            .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost {
                shards: vec![ManaCostShard::White],
                generic: 2,
            })
            .from_oracle_text_with_keywords(&["Enchant"], TIMELY_WARD)
            .id()
    }
    fn mana(color: ManaType, count: usize) -> Vec<ManaUnit> {
        vec![ManaUnit::new(color, ObjectId(9_900), false, vec![]); count]
    }
    fn cast(runner: &mut GameRunner, spell: ObjectId, payment_mode: CastPaymentMode) {
        let card_id = runner.state().objects[&spell].card_id;
        runner
            .act(GameAction::CastSpell {
                object_id: spell,
                card_id,
                targets: Vec::new(),
                payment_mode,
            })
            .expect("the cast is announced");
    }

    fn write(name: &str, state: GameState) {
        clear_game_state();
        let summary = {
            let p = state
                .waiting_for
                .pending_cast_ref()
                .or(state.pending_cast.as_deref());
            let wf = format!("{:?}", state.waiting_for);
            format!(
                "wf={} | energy={} life={} pool={} stack={} | pending={:?}",
                &wf[..wf.len().min(260)],
                state.players[0].energy,
                state.players[0].life,
                state.players[0].mana_pool.total(),
                state.stack.len(),
                p.map(|p| (
                    p.object_id,
                    p.casting_variant,
                    p.cast_timing_permission,
                    p.alternative_cost_election,
                    p.ability.context.alternative_mana_cost_paid,
                    format!("{:?}", p.cost)
                ))
            )
        };
        GAME_STATE.with(|cell| cell.set(Some(state)));
        let json = export_game_state_json().unwrap();
        let dir = std::env::var("FIXTURE_DIR").expect("FIXTURE_DIR");
        std::fs::write(format!("{dir}/{name}.json"), &json).unwrap();
        println!("V124FIX {name} bytes={} {summary}", json.len());
    }

    fn ward_at_target_selection(with_leyline: bool) -> GameRunner {
        let mut scenario = GameScenario::new();
        scenario.at_phase(Phase::Upkeep);
        if with_leyline {
            scenario.add_enchantment_from_oracle(P0, "Leyline of Anticipation", LEYLINE_OF_ANTICIPATION);
        }
        let ward = timely_ward(&mut scenario.add_spell_to_hand(P0, "Timely Ward", false));
        scenario.add_creature(P1, "Grizzly Bears", 2, 2).commander();
        scenario.add_creature(P0, "Grizzly Bears", 2, 2);
        scenario.with_mana_pool(P0, mana(ManaType::White, 4));
        let mut runner = scenario.build();
        cast(&mut runner, ward, CastPaymentMode::Auto);
        runner
    }

    fn azula() -> GameRunner {
        let mut scenario = GameScenario::new();
        scenario.at_phase(Phase::PostCombatMain);
        let azula = scenario
            .add_creature_to_hand_from_oracle(P0, "Azula, Cunning Usurper", 4, 4, AZULA_CUNNING_USURPER)
            .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost {
                shards: vec![ManaCostShard::Blue, ManaCostShard::Black, ManaCostShard::Black],
                generic: 2,
            })
            .id();
        scenario.add_creature(P0, "Grizzly Bears", 2, 2);
        scenario.add_creature(P1, "Grizzly Bears", 2, 2);
        let ward = timely_ward(&mut scenario.add_spell_to_graveyard(P1, "Timely Ward", false));
        for player in [P0, P1] {
            scenario.with_library_top(player, &["Library A", "Library B"]);
        }
        let mut pool = mana(ManaType::Black, 4);
        pool.extend(mana(ManaType::Blue, 1));
        scenario.with_mana_pool(P0, pool);
        let mut runner = scenario.build();
        cast(&mut runner, azula, CastPaymentMode::Auto);
        runner.advance_until_stack_empty();
        println!("azula ward zone {:?}", runner.state().objects[&ward].zone);
        for _ in 0..2 {
            runner.advance_to_phase(Phase::End);
            runner.advance_to_phase(Phase::Upkeep);
        }
        for unit in mana(ManaType::White, 3) {
            runner.state_mut().players[0].mana_pool.add(unit);
        }
        cast(&mut runner, ward, CastPaymentMode::Auto);
        runner
    }

    fn leyline_upkeep(
        pool: Vec<ManaUnit>,
        setup: impl FnOnce(&mut GameScenario) -> ObjectId,
    ) -> (GameRunner, ObjectId, ObjectId) {
        let mut scenario = GameScenario::new();
        scenario.at_phase(Phase::Upkeep);
        let leyline = scenario
            .add_enchantment_from_oracle(P0, "Leyline of Anticipation", LEYLINE_OF_ANTICIPATION)
            .id();
        let spell = setup(&mut scenario);
        scenario.with_mana_pool(P0, pool);
        (scenario.build(), leyline, spell)
    }
    fn drop_leyline(runner: &mut GameRunner, leyline: ObjectId) {
        engine::game::zones::move_to_zone(runner.state_mut(), leyline, Zone::Graveyard, &mut Vec::new());
    }
    fn bears_in_hand(scenario: &mut GameScenario) -> ObjectId {
        scenario
            .add_creature_to_hand(P0, "Grizzly Bears", 2, 2)
            .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost {
                shards: vec![ManaCostShard::Green],
                generic: 1,
            })
            .id()
    }
    fn gnarlid_cast(energy: u32, setup: impl FnOnce(&mut GameScenario)) -> (GameRunner, ObjectId) {
        let mut scenario = GameScenario::new();
        scenario.at_phase(Phase::Upkeep);
        setup(&mut scenario);
        let gnarlid = scenario
            .add_creature_to_hand(P0, "Gnarlid Colony", 2, 2)
            .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost {
                shards: vec![ManaCostShard::Green],
                generic: 1,
            })
            .with_subtypes(vec!["Beast"])
            .from_oracle_text_with_keywords(&["Kicker"], GNARLID_COLONY)
            .id();
        scenario.with_mana_pool(P0, mana(ManaType::Green, 6));
        let mut runner = scenario.build();
        runner.state_mut().players[0].energy = energy;
        cast(&mut runner, gnarlid, CastPaymentMode::Manual);
        (runner, gnarlid)
    }
    fn borne_upkeep(setup: impl FnOnce(&mut GameScenario) -> Vec<ObjectId>) -> (GameRunner, Vec<ObjectId>) {
        let mut scenario = GameScenario::new();
        scenario.at_phase(Phase::Upkeep);
        scenario.add_creature_from_oracle(P0, "Slitherwisp", 3, 2, SLITHERWISP);
        let borne = scenario
            .add_spell_to_hand_from_oracle(P0, "Borne Upon a Wind", true, BORNE_UPON_A_WIND)
            .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost {
                shards: vec![ManaCostShard::Blue],
                generic: 1,
            })
            .id();
        let spells = setup(&mut scenario);
        scenario.with_library_top(P0, &["Library A", "Library B", "Library C"]);
        let mut pool = mana(ManaType::Blue, 2);
        pool.extend(mana(ManaType::Green, 3));
        pool.extend(mana(ManaType::White, 2));
        scenario.with_mana_pool(P0, pool);
        let mut runner = scenario.build();
        cast(&mut runner, borne, CastPaymentMode::Auto);
        (runner, spells)
    }

    #[test]
    fn generate_v124_fixtures() {
        load_minimal_test_card_database();
        write("ward_spell_option", ward_at_target_selection(false).state().clone());
        write("ward_leyline", ward_at_target_selection(true).state().clone());
        write("azula_ward", azula().state().clone());

        // Naiad bestowed, Leyline removed
        {
            let (mut runner, leyline, naiad) = leyline_upkeep(mana(ManaType::Blue, 5), |scenario| {
                scenario.add_creature(P0, "Grizzly Bears", 2, 2);
                scenario.add_creature(P1, "Grizzly Bears", 2, 2);
                let mut builder = scenario.add_creature_to_hand(P0, "Nimbus Naiad", 2, 2);
                builder
                    .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost { shards: vec![ManaCostShard::Blue], generic: 2 })
                    .with_subtypes(vec!["Nymph"])
                    .from_oracle_text_with_keywords(&["Bestow", "Flying"], NIMBUS_NAIAD);
                builder.id()
            });
            let o = runner.state_mut().objects.get_mut(&naiad).unwrap();
            for types in [&mut o.card_types.core_types, &mut o.base_card_types.core_types] {
                types.push(engine::types::card_type::CoreType::Enchantment);
            }
            cast(&mut runner, naiad, CastPaymentMode::Auto);
            println!("naiad wf {:?}", runner.state().waiting_for);
            runner
                .act(GameAction::ChooseAlternativeCast {
                    choice: engine::types::actions::AlternativeCastDecision::Alternative,
                })
                .expect("bestow");
            drop_leyline(&mut runner, leyline);
            write("naiad_bestow_without_leyline", runner.state().clone());
        }
        // Wispmare evoked beside Prayers, Leyline removed
        {
            let (mut runner, leyline, wispmare) = leyline_upkeep(mana(ManaType::White, 1), |scenario| {
                scenario.add_enchantment_from_oracle(P0, "Primal Prayers", PRIMAL_PRAYERS);
                scenario
                    .add_creature_to_hand_from_oracle(P0, "Wispmare", 1, 3, WISPMARE)
                    .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost { shards: vec![ManaCostShard::White], generic: 2 })
                    .id()
            });
            runner.state_mut().players[0].energy = 2;
            cast(&mut runner, wispmare, CastPaymentMode::Manual);
            drop_leyline(&mut runner, leyline);
            write("wispmare_evoke_without_leyline", runner.state().clone());
        }
        {
            let (mut runner, leyline, opt) = leyline_upkeep(mana(ManaType::Blue, 1), |scenario| {
                scenario
                    .add_spell_to_hand_from_oracle(P0, "Opt", true, OPT)
                    .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost { shards: vec![ManaCostShard::Blue], generic: 0 })
                    .id()
            });
            cast(&mut runner, opt, CastPaymentMode::Manual);
            drop_leyline(&mut runner, leyline);
            write("opt_paying_without_leyline", runner.state().clone());
        }
        {
            let (mut runner, leyline, shock) = leyline_upkeep(mana(ManaType::Red, 1), |scenario| {
                scenario.add_creature(P1, "Grizzly Bears", 2, 2);
                scenario
                    .add_spell_to_hand_from_oracle(P0, "Shock", true, SHOCK)
                    .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost { shards: vec![ManaCostShard::Red], generic: 0 })
                    .id()
            });
            cast(&mut runner, shock, CastPaymentMode::Auto);
            drop_leyline(&mut runner, leyline);
            write("shock_targeting_without_leyline", runner.state().clone());
        }
        {
            let mut bears = None;
            let (mut runner, leyline, arc) = leyline_upkeep(mana(ManaType::Red, 3), |scenario| {
                bears = Some(scenario.add_creature(P1, "Grizzly Bears", 2, 2).id());
                scenario
                    .add_spell_to_hand_from_oracle(P0, "Arc Lightning", false, ARC_LIGHTNING)
                    .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost { shards: vec![ManaCostShard::Red], generic: 2 })
                    .id()
            });
            cast(&mut runner, arc, CastPaymentMode::Auto);
            runner
                .act(GameAction::SelectTargets {
                    targets: vec![
                        engine::types::ability::TargetRef::Object(bears.unwrap()),
                        engine::types::ability::TargetRef::Player(P1),
                    ],
                })
                .expect("two targets");
            drop_leyline(&mut runner, leyline);
            write("arc_lightning_division_without_leyline", runner.state().clone());
        }
        {
            let (mut runner, leyline, blaze) = leyline_upkeep(mana(ManaType::Red, 3), |scenario| {
                scenario
                    .add_spell_to_hand_from_oracle(P0, "Blaze", false, BLAZE)
                    .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost { shards: vec![ManaCostShard::X, ManaCostShard::Red], generic: 0 })
                    .id()
            });
            cast(&mut runner, blaze, CastPaymentMode::Auto);
            runner
                .act(GameAction::SelectTargets { targets: vec![engine::types::ability::TargetRef::Player(P1)] })
                .expect("P1");
            drop_leyline(&mut runner, leyline);
            write("blaze_x_without_leyline", runner.state().clone());
        }
        {
            let (mut runner, leyline, bears) = leyline_upkeep(mana(ManaType::Green, 4), |scenario| {
                scenario.add_creature_from_oracle(P0, "Defiler of Vigor", 6, 6, DEFILER_OF_VIGOR);
                bears_in_hand(scenario)
            });
            cast(&mut runner, bears, CastPaymentMode::Auto);
            drop_leyline(&mut runner, leyline);
            write("defiler_payment_without_leyline", runner.state().clone());
        }
        // Gnarlid + Prayers
        for energy in [1u32, 2] {
            let (runner, _) = gnarlid_cast(energy, |scenario| {
                scenario.add_enchantment_from_oracle(P0, "Primal Prayers", PRIMAL_PRAYERS);
            });
            write(&format!("prayers_gnarlid_energy{energy}"), runner.state().clone());
        }
        {
            let (runner, _) = gnarlid_cast(2, |scenario| {
                scenario.add_enchantment_from_oracle(P0, "Leyline of Anticipation", LEYLINE_OF_ANTICIPATION);
                scenario.add_enchantment_from_oracle(P0, "Primal Prayers", PRIMAL_PRAYERS);
            });
            write("leyline_prayers_gnarlid_energy2", runner.state().clone());
        }
        {
            let (runner, _) = gnarlid_cast(0, |scenario| {
                scenario.add_enchantment_from_oracle(P0, "Leyline of Anticipation", LEYLINE_OF_ANTICIPATION);
                scenario.add_enchantment_from_oracle(P0, "Primal Prayers", PRIMAL_PRAYERS);
            });
            write("leyline_prayers_gnarlid_energy0", runner.state().clone());
        }
        {
            let mut leyline = None;
            let (mut runner, _) = gnarlid_cast(0, |scenario| {
                leyline = Some(scenario.add_enchantment_from_oracle(P0, "Leyline of Anticipation", LEYLINE_OF_ANTICIPATION).id());
            });
            drop_leyline(&mut runner, leyline.unwrap());
            write("gnarlid_kicker_without_leyline", runner.state().clone());
        }
        {
            let (mut runner, _, bears) = leyline_upkeep(mana(ManaType::Green, 4), |scenario| {
                scenario.add_enchantment_from_oracle(P0, "Primal Prayers", PRIMAL_PRAYERS);
                scenario.add_creature_from_oracle(P0, "Defiler of Vigor", 6, 6, DEFILER_OF_VIGOR);
                bears_in_hand(scenario)
            });
            cast(&mut runner, bears, CastPaymentMode::Manual);
            println!("defiler-life wf {:?}", runner.state().waiting_for);
            runner.act(GameAction::DecideOptionalCost { pay: true }).expect("2 life");
            write("leyline_prayers_defiler_life_paid", runner.state().clone());
        }
        // Borne Upon a Wind
        let borne_board = |scenario: &mut GameScenario| {
            let bears = bears_in_hand(scenario);
            let viper = scenario
                .add_creature_to_hand(P0, "Ambush Viper", 2, 1)
                .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost { shards: vec![ManaCostShard::Green], generic: 1 })
                .with_subtypes(vec!["Snake"])
                .from_oracle_text_with_keywords(&["Flash", "Deathtouch"], "Flash\nDeathtouch")
                .id();
            vec![bears, viper]
        };
        {
            let (runner, ids) = borne_upkeep(borne_board);
            println!("borne ids bears/viper/lions {ids:?}");
            write("borne_on_the_stack", runner.state().clone());
        }
        {
            let (mut runner, ids) = borne_upkeep(borne_board);
            runner.resolve_top();
            write("borne_resolving_optional_prompt", runner.state().clone());
            runner.act(GameAction::DecideOptionalEffect { accept: true }).expect("accept");
            println!("after accept wf {:?} stack {}", runner.state().waiting_for, runner.state().stack.len());
            cast(&mut runner, ids[0], CastPaymentMode::Manual);
            write("borne_resolved_bears_paying", runner.state().clone());
        }
        {
            let (mut runner, ids) = borne_upkeep(|scenario| {
                scenario.add_creature_from_oracle(P0, "Chea, Friend to Maybe Too Many", 2, 4, CHEA_FRIEND_TO_MAYBE_TOO_MANY);
                vec![scenario
                    .add_creature_to_hand(P0, "Savannah Lions", 2, 1)
                    .with_mana_cost(ManaCost::Cost { shards: vec![ManaCostShard::White], generic: 0 })
                    .with_subtypes(vec!["Cat"])
                    .id()]
            });
            runner.resolve_top();
            runner.act(GameAction::DecideOptionalEffect { accept: true }).expect("accept");
            println!("chea lions {ids:?}");
            write("borne_resolved_chea", runner.state().clone());
        }
        // Crawling Barrens: an unrelated "you may" GenericEffect still on the stack.
        {
            let mut scenario = GameScenario::new();
            scenario.at_phase(Phase::PreCombatMain);
            let barrens = scenario
                .add_land_from_oracle(P0, "Crawling Barrens", "{T}: Add {C}.\n{4}: Put two +1/+1 counters on this land. Then you may have it become a 0/0 Elemental creature until end of turn. It's still a land.")
                .id();
            scenario.with_mana_pool(P0, mana(ManaType::Colorless, 4));
            let mut runner = scenario.build();
            let abil = runner.state().objects[&barrens].abilities.len();
            println!("barrens abilities {abil}");
            for idx in 0..abil {
                if runner.act(GameAction::ActivateAbility { source_id: barrens, ability_index: idx, payment_mode: CastPaymentMode::Auto }).is_ok() && runner.state().stack.len() == 1 {
                    println!("barrens activated idx {idx}");
                    break;
                }
            }
            write("crawling_barrens_on_the_stack", runner.state().clone());
        }
        // Fist of Suns: an alternative cost offered, not paid, under Leyline's legacy route.
        {
            let (mut runner, _, bears) = leyline_upkeep(
                [ManaType::White, ManaType::Blue, ManaType::Black, ManaType::Red, ManaType::Green, ManaType::Green]
                    .into_iter()
                    .flat_map(|c| mana(c, 1))
                    .collect(),
                |scenario| {
                    scenario.add_artifact_from_oracle(P0, "Fist of Suns", "You may pay {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than pay the mana cost for spells you cast.");
                    bears_in_hand(scenario)
                },
            );
            cast(&mut runner, bears, CastPaymentMode::Manual);
            write("leyline_fist_of_suns_offered", runner.state().clone());
        }
        // Primal Prayers, Beast Whisperer, and a creature with no additional cost.
        {
            let mut scenario = GameScenario::new();
            scenario.at_phase(Phase::Upkeep);
            scenario.add_enchantment_from_oracle(P0, "Primal Prayers", PRIMAL_PRAYERS);
            scenario.add_creature_from_oracle(P0, "Beast Whisperer", 2, 3, BEAST_WHISPERER);
            let bears = bears_in_hand(&mut scenario);
            scenario.with_library_top(P0, &["Library A", "Library B", "Library C"]);
            let mut runner = scenario.build();
            runner.state_mut().players[0].energy = 2;
            cast(&mut runner, bears, CastPaymentMode::Auto);
            write("prayers_bears_whisperer_energy2", runner.state().clone());
        }
    }
}
